    DRAFT --> DEFERRED: deferred [reason_recorded]
    DRAFT --> DROPPED: dropped [reason_recorded]
    DRAFT --> PLANNED: promoted [promotion_contract_complete]
    DEFERRED --> DRAFT: reactivated [none]
    DEFERRED --> DROPPED: dropped [reason_recorded]
    PLANNED --> CLAIMED: claimed [lease_held]
    PLANNED --> CANCELLED: cancelled [reason_recorded]
    CLAIMED --> RUNNING: started [run_bound]
    CLAIMED --> PLANNED: lease_released [reason_recorded]
    CLAIMED --> CANCELLED: cancelled [reason_recorded]
    RUNNING --> READY_TO_INTEGRATE: ready [run_report_bound+criteria_evidence_bound]
    RUNNING --> FAILED: failed [run_report_bound+reason_recorded]
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: cancelled [reason_recorded]
    READY_TO_INTEGRATE --> COMPLETED: completed [integrated_binding_pinned]
    READY_TO_INTEGRATE --> PLANNED: replanned [reason_recorded]
    READY_TO_INTEGRATE --> FAILED: failed [reason_recorded]
